---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
import Carousel from '../components/Carousel.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Punk Lotus — Brand Consulting for Creative Founders"
  description="Zero-bullshit brand and communications consulting for creative founders. Brand creation, communication foundations, rebrands, launches & more. Based in northern NSW."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Brand consulting for creative founders.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="wrap measure">
      <h2 class="lede">Building brand foundations with strategy and style that fit.</h2>
      <p>Whether you're starting from scratch, super busy or simply want to collaborate, the work we do together is shaped around your reality, personality, needs and resources.</p>
      <p>That means building from the foundations up: positioning, audience, messaging, voice, and visual identity; or picking up wherever things have come unstuck.</p>
      <p>If you've outgrown your current brand, we rebrand it. If you're launching something new, we build the communication strategy to take it to market.</p>
      <p>If you're established and need ongoing strategic or general marketing support, that's what you get.</p>
      <p>This is about getting over the hump, and getting it done.</p>
      <p><a class="more" href="/brandconsulting">See the work →</a> &nbsp; <a class="more" href="/about">About Kirsty →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark process">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Process</h2>
      <Carousel label="Process" perView={2} tone="dark">
        <li class="step"><span class="num">01</span><p>Together, we develop a plan that's realistic, strategic and personal. From there, you receive a clear proposal: scope, deliverables and different price points to choose from.</p></li>
        <li class="step"><span class="num">02</span><p>The work is delivered in stages, with check-ins and approvals along the way. This keeps the strategy grounded in what you really need, and flexible to changes.</p></li>
        <li class="step"><span class="num">03</span><p>The work comes to life. A brand launched, a campaign live, a rebrand rolled out, a website live. We can keep working together as you grow, or you carry it forward on your own.</p></li>
      </Carousel>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap contact">
      <div>
        <h2>It’s ok to ask for help.<br /><span class="plain">It’s literally my job.</span></h2>
        <p><a href="mailto:kt@punklotus.com">kt@punklotus.com</a><br /><a href="tel:+61468825419">0468 825 419</a></p>
      </div>
      <ContactForm name="contact-home" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .step { border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); padding: 8px 0 8px 24px; }
  .plain { color: var(--charcoal); opacity: .75; }
  .num { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--orange); font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: .3em; }
  .contact { display: grid; gap: 40px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); align-items: start; }
  .contact a { color: var(--charcoal); font-weight: 700; }
</style>
